<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Dear&nbsp;[BPL Name],<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">[Add personal introduction]<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Thank you for all that you are doing for patients in need! I
so appreciate your efforts to help increase our Power Red collections. Power
Red technology at your drive helps reach your blood drive goal by maximizing
each person’s donation.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">There are two easy ways to help to spread the word and get
more Power Red donors!<o:p></o:p></p>

<ol style="margin-top:0in" start="1" type="1">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in"><b>Educate:</b>&nbsp;Share
     the&nbsp;<u><a href="https://youtu.be/1ifvfARmX78?si=iRas2w4pGQ66_Vo2">“What
     is a Power Red Donation?”</a></u>&nbsp;video with potential donors.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in"><b>Ask:&nbsp;</b>Share
     the benefits of a Power Red donation with your donor base and encourage
     eligible donors to donate Power Reds instead of whole blood – and use
     the&nbsp;attached poster&nbsp;at your drives.<o:p></o:p></li>
</ol>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Power Red benefits:<o:p></o:p></p>

<ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><b>Help
     save more lives:</b>&nbsp;Red blood cells are the most commonly
     transfused&nbsp;blood component, and therefore the most needed.<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><b>Maximize
     your impact:</b>&nbsp;Help more patients with one scheduled appointment!<o:p></o:p></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><b>Comfortable
     experience:</b>&nbsp;A smaller needle is used; you are more hydrated after
     your donation, and you only have to&nbsp;donate once every 112 days or
     four months.<o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

