<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><i>See current requirements on&nbsp;<u><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/how-to-donate/eligibility-requirements.html">RedCrossBlood.org</a></u>.</i><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Please feel free to contact me with any questions. Thank you
so much for your continued support of our lifesaving mission!<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Best regards,<o:p></o:p></p>

